def ramadan_page():
    body = pagehero("Tools", "Ramadan in Saudi Arabia", "When the holy month begins, what changes for travellers, and why Umrah in Ramadan is unlike any other time.", "makkah.webp") + f'''
<section><div class="wrap tool-wrap">
<div class="toolgrid">
<div class="toolcard rv"><h3>Countdown to Ramadan</h3><p class="tool-big" id="ramCount">Loading...</p><p class="tool-note" id="ramStart"></p></div>
<div class="toolcard rv"><h3>Key dates (expected)</h3><ul class="tool-dates" id="ramDates"><li>Loading...</li></ul>
<p class="tool-note">From the calculated Islamic calendar. The official start is confirmed in Saudi Arabia by the sighting of the moon and can move by a day.</p></div>
</div>
<div class="toolcard rv"><h3>Travelling during Ramadan</h3>
<p>Ramadan is the month of fasting: from dawn to sunset, Muslims refrain from food and drink, and the rhythm of the Kingdom changes around it. Days are quieter, offices and shops often open later, and everything comes alive after sunset - iftar (the breaking of the fast) is a social feast, and the nights run long with prayers, markets and family gatherings.</p>
<p style="margin-top:10px">Visitors are welcome throughout. Out of respect, avoid eating, drinking or smoking in public during fasting hours; most hotels and many restaurants serve discreetly behind screens. Dress a little more conservatively than usual, and accept iftar invitations - they are a genuine honour.</p></div>
<div class="toolcard rv"><h3>Umrah in Ramadan</h3>
<p>Umrah in Ramadan carries a special reward in Islamic tradition and the Two Holy Mosques are at their most atmospheric - and their busiest. Book Nusuk permits early, expect crowds around iftar and the night prayers, and plan your energy around the fast if you are observing it. The last ten nights, which include Laylat al-Qadr (the Night of Decree), are the peak of the month.</p>
<p style="margin-top:10px">A tourist eVisa covers Umrah outside Hajj season for eligible nationalities - check your route on our <a href="../eligibility.html">eligibility page</a>, and our team can prepare your application around the Ramadan rush.</p></div>
</div></section>''' + cta_band()
    return chrome("Ramadan Dates, Countdown & Traveller Guide - Saudi Arabia", "When Ramadan starts (expected), the countdown, key dates including Laylat al-Qadr and Eid al-Fitr, and a traveller's guide to the holy month in Saudi Arabia.", body, prefix="../")

